        {
            "heading": "Buildings",
            "level": 2,
            "content": [
                {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "text": "Unlike standard holdings, most buildings in a tribal holding cost Prestige instead of Wealth . The exceptions are hillforts, markets and fortifications. (Buildings that cost prestige usually still cost 1 wealth to build)"
                }
            ]
        },
